This project reproduces AI-Scientist-v3 by Sakana AI
(https://github.com/SakanaAI/AI-Scientist-v3) as a Polaris graph. It is built
on polaris_code (https://github.com/RadiantAILabs/polaris_code).

Parts of this repository are derived from AI-Scientist-v3, Copyright 2026
Sakana AI, which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Each of
these folders keeps its own LICENSE and NOTICE. The NOTICE of a folder lists
the files taken from AI-Scientist-v3 and what was changed in each of them.

- crates/polaris_scientist/assets/prompts/paper
  Paper-writing prompts and skills. See the NOTICE in that folder.
- crates/polaris_scientist/assets/prompts/research
  Research prompts and skills. See the NOTICE in that folder.
- crates/polaris_scientist/assets/venues/iclr
  The ICLR paper template and the venue brief. See the NOTICE in that folder.
